  request/capsule contract currency inputs; canonical mapping version +
  certification + ambiguity rejection
- test_gate.py: capsule-side None coverage, stale-version tests, truthy
  non-boolean status tests, collision tests, manifest-driven suite
- fixtures.json: schema v2 with complete candidate_fields; loaded by tests
- README.md: 26-test expected outcome and coverage list

Repo:
- README.md Contents: section-5 spec + experiments folder added
- research-validation-ledger.md: R3 row updated to 26/26 conformance result
